# Experimental results

Run the notebook from top to bottom to generate the experimental outputs.

The notebook produces:
- Exploratory data-analysis charts.
- Popularity-based book recommendations.
- Content-based recommendations for a selected title.
- Collaborative-filtering recommendations for a selected ISBN.
- Hybrid recommendation rankings.
- `model_evaluation_results.csv` with Precision@10, Recall@10, and HitRate@10 for
  the popularity baseline and collaborative item-KNN holdout experiment.

Do not fill in metric values until the notebook has been executed successfully on the
chosen dataset. Save exported charts and the generated CSV here if you want to include
them in the final GitHub submission.
